{"seq":12,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:15:13.216Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e6c5c73068583bc1148b02631f7ff419fe2b9635b532ee099372d6dc9d1ad017","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, I found two of the three clearly. The third is only implied in the sources.\n\n1. **Who took over and when:** Moss's Coastal notes say Saltmarsh Provisions changed hands on Monday, 6 October 2025. They don't name the new owner. Later material calls it \"Bettina's grocery account\", and Bettina Kroll's 17 November post calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". That points to Bettina Kroll, but nothing states it outright, so please confirm it before it goes in the handover file. Don't confuse this with Pellucid Harbor Logistics. That account changed hands on 3 November, and Kwame took it over fully on 22 November.\n2. **Discount:** 10%. On 17 November Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it to 10% because she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet. The correction came from a channel post, not a contract document, so check it against the signed paperwork if the file needs a firm figure.\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827. Kwame opened it on 15 October 2025. Corinne's admin option had disappeared from Pemberline Dock, and her login still worked."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
